{"h":3395,"lines":[{"x":0.21168574841636401,"w":0.053994757334391241,"t":"Test 2","h":0.014132828819176102,"c":1,"y":0.10703242265919888},{"c":1,"w":0.016460905075073223,"t":"G","y":0.23401162771942807,"x":0.20987654322965915,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.14920309248458186,"c":1,"x":0.24270768981425458,"w":0.6915349324544271,"t":"In fact, research shows that, when innovating, the best approach is to create an environment","h":0.016102551571472001},{"y":0.16388482868966003,"w":0.66275792439778647,"x":0.25092364529395295,"t":"devoid of structure and hierarchy and enable everyone involved to engage as one organic","h":0.01708713100150272,"c":1},{"y":0.17977404628981875,"x":0.25096892691003014,"h":0.015847055033042401,"c":1,"t":"group. These environments can lead to new solutions that, under conventionally structured","w":0.67502415974934904},{"x":0.25088306073200312,"y":0.19394796123273117,"h":0.019738826369789964,"c":1,"t":"environments (filled with bottlenecks in terms of information flow, power structures, rules,","w":0.6772817993164062},{"y":0.21058883759672464,"c":1,"t":"and routines) would never be reached.","x":0.25090844005975443,"w":0.28421470642089841,"h":0.014457374074012597},{"x":0.24475062299986974,"c":1,"y":0.23395637576299744,"h":0.017644529488679228,"t":"In recent times companies have slowly started to embrace this disorganisation. Many of","w":0.66067754109700527},{"c":1,"x":0.25088791000458227,"y":0.24941873359353584,"h":0.018080984886178486,"w":0.63811487833658864,"t":"them embrace it in terms of perception (embracing the idea of disorder, as opposed to"},{"y":0.26492103084201823,"h":0.017384911032812589,"t":"fearing it) and in terms of process (putting mechanisms in place to reduce structure).","w":0.62990575154622408,"x":0.25088678741253051,"c":1},{"y":0.28919674958645969,"t":"For example, Oticon, a large Danish manufacturer of hearing aids, used what it called a","w":0.65251551310221356,"h":0.018733673859541278,"c":1,"x":0.24883960871305799},{"y":0.30343936863307852,"w":0.65866465250651041,"t":"'spaghetti' structure in order to reduce the organisation's rigid hierarchies. This involved","x":0.2488516902064983,"h":0.017819190615057545,"c":1},{"t":"scrapping formal job titles and giving staff huge amounts of ownership over their own time","y":0.32048104746208872,"c":1,"x":0.24684011698094915,"w":0.68120895385742197,"h":0.01725008855579313},{"t":"and projects. This approach proved to be highly successful initially, with clear improvements","y":0.33517834763428689,"h":0.019053318756067528,"w":0.69361068725585939,"x":0.24681397587999679,"c":1},{"y":0.35174418591840839,"w":0.38065844217936196,"t":"in worker productivity in all facets of the business.","x":0.24897119020561964,"h":0.01309680320910489,"c":1},{"y":0.37550428797212143,"w":0.64211908976236987,"x":0.24889779481045063,"h":0.015507790168968971,"c":1,"t":"In similar fashion, the former chairman of General Electric embraced disorganisation,"},{"t":"putting forward the idea of the 'boundaryless' organisation. Again, it involves breaking","h":0.020830421762275453,"y":0.38879888914329364,"x":0.24678460302426855,"w":0.65051320393880208,"c":1},{"h":0.018330123034186352,"c":1,"t":"down the barriers between different parts of a company and encouraging virtual","x":0.24881660553208843,"y":0.40541064620395084,"w":0.59287267049153647},{"w":0.64833572387695315,"y":0.42138214016362774,"t":"collaboration and flexible working. Google and a number of other tech companies have","h":0.016469527470349354,"x":0.24887638630395997,"c":1},{"w":0.66899353027343766,"h":0.019444567856715556,"x":0.24677809392839503,"y":0.43583736878851376,"t":"embraced (at least in part) these kinds of flexible structures, facilitated by technology and","c":1},{"h":0.014548579711374909,"c":1,"y":0.45347467621836235,"w":0.38477366129557289,"x":0.24485596760324238,"t":"strong company values which glue people together."},{"c":1,"w":0.66889943440755206,"h":0.016515151069919631,"y":0.47638725034819462,"t":"A word of warning to others thinking of jumping on this bandwagon: the evidence so far","x":0.24064188651580498},{"h":0.016359462895297772,"c":1,"w":0.68534886678059892,"t":"suggests disorder, much like order, also seems to have diminishing utility, and can also have","x":0.24683851800118323,"y":0.49166625651798701},{"y":0.50693210819475554,"c":1,"x":0.24884843805977255,"h":0.017431414169473247,"t":"detrimental effects on performance if overused. Like order, disorder should be embraced","w":0.65660207112630209},{"t":"only so far as it is useful. But we should not fear it - nor venerate one over the other.","c":1,"w":0.62775105794270836,"x":0.24888619227104375,"h":0.014898141786824692,"y":0.52253779717632365},{"t":"This research also shows that we should continually question whether or not our existing","c":1,"h":0.018128866862913706,"y":0.53720491743758303,"x":0.24883417310882749,"w":0.65869959513346354},{"c":1,"h":0.015414597429291188,"y":0.55240075322030935,"w":0.14043394724527994,"t":"assumptions work.","x":0.246597949773362},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.86337209284624106,"w":0.024691357612609849,"t":"48","x":0.19958847747876804}],"w":2400}